            <profile id="9690-d2ac-3dbc-4c56" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="fcb9-17be-94c2-bcfc" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">An Army Standard Bearer has a hand weapon, light armour and shield. Army Standard Bearer. An Irish Standard bearer may ride a horse (+12) in which case he becomes Ld7. A Feudal Standard Bearer may ride a warhorse (+21) in which case he becomes Ld 8. He may have heavy armour (+1)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
